<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Booking Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
        <h2 style="color: #FF5A5F;">Your Booking is Confirmed!</h2>
        <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>
        <p>Great news! Your booking at <strong>{{propertyName}}</strong> has been confirmed.</p>
        
        <div style="background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Reservation Details:</h3>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0;">
                <li><strong>Check-in:</strong> {{checkIn}}</li>
                <li><strong>Check-out:</strong> {{checkOut}}</li>
                <li><strong>Total Amount:</strong> ${{bookingAmount}}</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>If you have any questions or need to make changes, please visit your account dashboard.</p>
        <p>Thanks for choosing our service!</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>The AirBnb Clone Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
